{
  "id": "news-broadcast",
  "abi": "8",
  "name": "突发新闻",
  "keywords": [
    "新闻",
    "突发",
    "速报",
    "新闻卡",
    "播报",
    "竖版",
    "键盘声"
  ],
  "when": "固定竖版突发新闻模板：径向蓝底 + 世界地图 + 流动线，只写标题、正文、来源与可选品牌；标题/正文可用行首 * 标黄重点行，无旁白、无字幕",
  "blocks": [
    "scene.news"
  ],
  "style": {
    "fonts": {
      "display": "WenYuanSerifSC-Bold",
      "body": "WenYuanSerifSC-Bold",
      "brand": "sans-900",
      "num": "latin-700"
    },
    "colors": {
      "bg": "#08245E",
      "ink": "#F7FAFF",
      "muted": "#9DB8E8",
      "accent": "#FFD24A",
      "line": "#214C96"
    },
    "backgrounds": {
      "night": "#08245E"
    }
  },
  "rules": {
    "safeMargin": 0.055,
    "scale": {
      "title": 1,
      "content": 1,
      "source": 0.9,
      "brand": 0.8
    },
    "stroke": [
      1,
      2
    ],
    "forbid": [
      "给 scene.news 传未声明字段；固定模板只接受 title / content / source / brand",
      "让 scene.news 自动折行；分行只能由 title / content 里的 \\n 决定",
      "在同一幕再叠一层字幕；本 recipe 画面文字即正文，字幕必须为 none",
      "给本 recipe 写 narration 或依赖 TTS；新闻卡只用打字机与 BGM",
      "修改蓝底、地图、网格或流动线的版式；背景属于 TT.newsBg 公共 kit，其他新闻 recipe 复用而不是复制"
    ]
  },
  "captions": {
    "style": "none"
  },
  "audio": {
    "mood": "tense",
    "volume": 0.6,
    "fadeIn": 1.2,
    "fadeOut": 2,
    "duck": {
      "level": 0.055,
      "edge": 0.15
    }
  },
  "verify": [
    {
      "at": 0.15,
      "assert": "ink.insideSafe",
      "args": {
        "margin": 0.055
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "element.count.gte",
      "args": {
        "n": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "at": 0.9,
      "assert": "caption.noOverlapSubject",
      "args": {}
    }
  ]
}
